 if(num == 0) {
 //Schema only
 return new PlanFragment(null, schema, null);
 }
{code}
moving the call earlier in \{{getPlanFragment}} ... right after the HiveConf is created ... bypassing the code that uses \{{HiveTxnManager}} and \{{Driver}}.
